{
  "title": "Aromatic Asian Comte Rice Bowl",
  "description": "A sweet and savory Malaysian dish featuring Comte cheese, served in a stone bowl, perfect for a quick and satisfying meal. This satvik-friendly recipe is made with earthenware bowl and is easy to prepare.",
  "cuisine": "Malaysian",
